  "description": "Provides high-performance Redis integration for TuanZi applications, featuring:\n\t\t\t- Distributed caching implementation\n\t\t\t- Support for all Redis data structures (strings, hashes, lists, etc.)\n\t\t\t- Connection pooling and multiplexing\n\t\t\t- Cache expiration and eviction policies\n\t\t\t- Redis Sentinel and Cluster support\n\t\t\t- Pipeline and transaction operations\n\t\t\t- Pub/Sub messaging capabilities\n\t\t\t- Lua scripting execution\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi caching abstractions",
